    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amazia kūbiza ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Amazia aho alandya kūbiza ntemi walī na myaka makūmi abīlī n'ītanò; ūsuga alī mu Yelusalemu ikanza lya myaka makūmi abīlī na kenda. Ū nina walī muna Yelusalemu, lina lyakwe witanagwa Yehoadini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Amazia akīīta yawiza ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA; gwike ītī mu ng'holò shikanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wabona gīkī wabūdima chiza ū būsugi, ūbabūlaga a batūmami ba mu būsugi bokwe abo baalī bamūlaga ū ntemi ū ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bitūnja ba babūlagi benabo atababūlagile, akīīta ūmo yandīkīlilwe mu shilagīlo, ū mu shitabo sha ng'wa Musa; ūmo SEEBA alagīlile, “A babyaji yaya ū kūbūlagwa kūlwa nguno ya būhūbi wa baana babo, na a baana batizūūbūlagwa kūlwa nguno ya būhūbi wa babyaji babo; būlī munhū akūcha kūlwa būhūbi wakwe wei ng'wenekīlī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Amazia ūbitana pye a banhū ba Yuda, ūbahela būlī bene kūlenganīla na kaya ja bakūlūgenji babo; hanuma a bose pyī, ū mu Yuda nī Benjamini, ūbatūūlīla bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale shihūmbī shihūmbī, na ga bashilikale igana igana. Hanuma ya henaho ūbabala abo baalī ba kwandīja myaka makūmi abīlī na kūja kwigūlya. Ūbona gīkī baalīho bagosha shihūmbī magana adatū abo baalī badūgije kwingīla mu būlūgū, abo baalī badūgije kūdima machimu na kūbūūcha mūda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūgoodisha na bashilikale bangī shihūmbī igana, kūfuma Isilaeli; ūfunya feza tani ja kūkīla h'idatū na nusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo munhū o ng'wa Mulungu wiza ūng'wīla ū Amazia, “Ee ntemi, a bashilikale ba kūfuma Isilaeli benaba shitigelile babize hamò nang'ho; nguno ū SEEBA atī hamò na a Baisilaeli; atī hamò na banhū bose bose a ba Efulaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūlaje ū kū būlūgū, h'ūmo widadīlīle dūhū, ū Mulungu akūkūgwisha ū kū būtongi wa banishi bako; nguno ū Mulungu alī nabo ū būdūla wa kūgunanha nūūlū kūgwisha!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Amazia ūbūūja, “Al'ī tani ja feza ījo naajifunije kūlwa bashilikale ba Isilaeli, kinehe ī jene?” Ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu ūnshokeja, “Ū SEEBA adūgije kūkwinha na kūtinda ho a henaho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Amazia ūbalaga ng'hana a bashilikale abo baalī biza kūfuma Efulaimu, būshoka kaya bīpelanīlaga no ī Yuda; bashoka ī kaya basaayile kībi no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Amazia wiluma lya sīlīlī, ūja nī libità lyakwe ū kū sī ya ntubīlo; īyo yalī sī ya munhu, ūūkabūlaga banhū ba Seili shihūmbī ikūmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī libità lya banhū ba Yuda lyūdima na banhū bapanga shihūmbī ikūmi; būbatwala kwigūlya ya lūgegu lūlīhu lw'ing'oong'ho. Būyūbashindīka kwīngīīla henaho, baakagwa hasī batandagūka; būshila kūcha pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo gashi ū kū numa, a mabità ayo akagalemeja ū Amazia kūja kū būlūgū gīdumīla mizengo ya Yuda kwandīja Samalia kūja Beti-holoni. Būbūlaga banhū shihūmbī shidatū; būsola na shikolo shingī būshijaana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amazia kūpyenwa mu būlūgū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Amazia aho washoka ū kūfuma ū kūbabūlaga a Baedomu, wenhanīja na shiikolile sha bamulungu ba Seili. Ūshitūūla kūbiza bamulungu bakwe, ūyūshilamya na kūshifunīja shitambò sha kūpemvwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūmpelanīla no ū Amazia, ūntūmīla ng'hangi ūūkang'wīla, “Ni kinehe ūlīkooba būgunanhwa kūfuma ū kū bamulungu benaba abo baalī balemeelilwe ū kūbapīja a banhū babo ū kūfuma ū mu nkono gwako?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho ataalī ūhaya gīko, ū ntemi ūng'wīla, “Ū bebe, twakūsolile nanalī kūbiza nyangūji wa ntemi? Fulīkaga! Nibūlī nose wiyenheleje kūkenaagūlwa?” Na ng'hana ū ng'hangi ng'wenūyo ūfulīka; alīyo ūneka alīhaya, “Nalībona gīkī ū SEEBA atogilwe kūkūyagaja īkī wītile mhayo gūlī gīko, hama ī haha ū būyangūji wane wabūlema.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Amazia ūhooya na a baganikīji bakwe; hūna ūtwala nhūng'wa kūlī Yehoashi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehoahazi, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehu, ū ntemi wa Isilaeli; ūng'wīla, “Nzūgū tūpamanye būshū kū būshū ū bebe nū nene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yehoashi ūnshokeja ū Amazia ū ntemi wa Yuda ūng'wīla, “Kagwata kalebe kakigīmba gīmba ng'wipoolu lya Lebanoni, kūūtwala mhola kū ntī gwa manga ū mu Lebanoni ng'wenūmo; kūlagīja kalīhaya, ‘Nfunyage ū nshīke wako atoolwe nū ng'witūnja wane!’ Alīyo kwimanīla shiinū ya muumo Lebanoni ng'wenūmo yūbītīla ī mhandī jenījo, yūkapandagīla a kagwata kenako! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe angū ūkwilembagūlaga īkī wabapyenile bana Edomu, h'ī chene wītile na lūgiili giili ūkwikumīlījaga. Bebe ni wayegela būtindi wako dūhū, wikale kū ng'wako kwenūko! Ī gete waseseelilwe kī, nose ūlīhaya kwiyenheleja makoye ga kūkūgwisha ū bebe nī Yuda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Amazia atigwile, nguno ū Mulungu walī ahelile gīkī abatūūle mu nkono go ng'wa Yehoashi, nguno baalī bagalūkīla kū bamulungu ba Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ū Yehoashi ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūbūūka kūjūndumīla; na ng'hana ū wei nū Amazia ū ntemi wa Yuda būpamanya būshū kū būshū balī Beti-shemeshi mu sī ya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Yuda yūpyenwa kībi no na a Baisilaeli, būlī munhū ūpeela ashokile kū ng'wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balī ū mu būlūgū wa Beti-shemeshi wenūbo, ū Yehoashi ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūndima ū Amazia ū ntemi wa Yuda, ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yoashi, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ahazia. Hūna ū Yehoashi ūja nang'hwe ī Yelusalemu ūkīgwisha ī ndugu ya Yelusalemu kwandīja kū mita gwa Efulaimu kūja kū mita gwa kū lūpembe, ibbaala lya būlīhu wa fuuti magana atandatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī zahabu nī feza ūjisola, pyī nī shikolo ī shingī īsho akapandīka kūfuma mu hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu, īsho shalī ha sīlīlī ya būlang'hani bo ng'wa Obedi-edomu, nī sha kūfuma ū mu mabīkīlo ga sabo ga mu numba y'ikūlū; ūdima na banhū ba kūjana; hūna ūshoka Samalia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
